WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.320
Tom gave the new nightcap to the royal grandmother.

2
00:00:09.321 --> 00:00:12.966
"What took you so long?" she snapped.

3
00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:16.503
She put the nightcap on her head.

4
00:00:16.504 --> 00:00:21.245
"Now I wish for a guard!" she said.

5
00:00:21.246 --> 00:00:25.959
Poof! A guard dog appeared.

6
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.533
It had three heads.

7
00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:31.118
They all growled at Tom.

8
00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:33.951
The royal grandmother looked at Tom.

9
00:00:33.952 --> 00:00:37.140
"Your magic is getting better, Wizard!"

10
00:00:37.141 --> 00:00:42.269
Tom shook his head. "I didn't do anything."

11
00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.938
"Tom," Cat whispered.

12
00:00:44.939 --> 00:00:48.203
"I think the nightcap is a wishing cap."

13
00:00:48.204 --> 00:00:52.910
Tom gasped. "A wishing cap?"

14
00:00:52.911 --> 00:00:56.863
"A wishing cap?" said the royal grandmother.

15
00:00:56.864 --> 00:01:01.655
"Hmm. I wish this dog was a tiger."

16
00:01:01.656 --> 00:01:09.950
Poof! The dog turned into a tiger.

17
00:01:09.951 --> 00:01:12.519
The royal grandmother smiled.

18
00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:16.259
"I've always wanted a wishing cap!" she said.

19
00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:26.017
Tom bowed. "I'm glad you're happy."

20
00:01:26.018 --> 00:01:31.658
Tom found the king.

21
00:01:31.659 --> 00:01:35.101
"The royal grandmother is happy now," he said.

22
00:01:35.102 --> 00:01:38.570
"All her wishes came true."

23
00:01:38.571 --> 00:01:46.063
The king clapped. "Wonderful, Tom!"

24
00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:48.886
"Be careful, Tom," Cat whispered.

25
00:01:48.887 --> 00:01:50.737
"Wishing caps are—"

26
00:01:50.738 --> 00:01:55.545
Poof! Suddenly the king's throne disappeared.

27
00:01:55.546 --> 00:01:58.507
"Ack!" cried the king. "Oof!"

28
00:01:58.508 --> 00:02:03.457
He landed hard on the floor.

29
00:02:03.458 --> 00:02:07.006
The royal grandmother sat on her new throne.

30
00:02:07.007 --> 00:02:10.659
"What a nice throne!" she said.

31
00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:14.542
"I like that tiger too.

32
00:02:14.543 --> 00:02:21.384
Maybe I'll stay at this castle forever!"

